  m_text: "Escalation often moves through phases. If you can name the phase you're
    in, you can choose the response that fits it.\n\nCALM \u2192 \nTRIGGER \u2192
    \nAGITATION \u2192 \nACCELERATION \u2192 \nPEAK \u2192 \nDE-ESCALATION \u2192
    \nRECOVERY\n\nThe earlier you step in, the less there is to manage later."
